 "note": "Thomas C. Passios Elementary School: lines 1-8 describe and list the Passios Elementary School Council, and the FACULTY list (heading line 9) follows it; the page prints no other school. The School Council (lines 1-8: Principal, Teachers, Parents, Community Rep.) is a governance body, not staff, so those lines are ignored. Layout: two columns, each a label and a name (x 0.11/0.24 and 0.54/0.72). Left-column office labels (Principal, Asst. Prin., Secretary, Nurse) are titles and go in role_raw; grade labels and every right-column label are section labels governing the names below them and go in grade_or_dept. Line 10's Joyce Wass is in the right column with no label printed above or beside her, so role_raw and grade_or_dept are both empty. '(Pri.)' is kept in role_raw as printed (it marks the Primary School). Line 50 is the page number."
